      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wiilka Aadamow, seef af badan soo qaado, oo sida mandiisha rayiislaha ugu isticmaal, oo waxaad ku xiirataa madaxa iyo gadhka, oo markaas kafado soo qaado si aad timaha ugu miisaantid, oo kala qaybi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Timaha saddexdooda dalool dalool magaalada dhexdeeda dab ku gub markii maalmaha weerarku ay dhammaystirmaan, oo haddana waxaad qaadataa dalool kale, oo magaalada hareereheeda seefta la dhac, oo daloolka saddexaadna dabaysha ku kala firdhi, oo aniguna seef baan ka daba qaadan doonaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo weliba wuxoogaa yar qaad oo daraftaada gunud. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo haddana kuwaas qaar ka qaad oo dab ku dhex tuur, oo dab ku gub, oo iyaga dab baa ka soo bixi doona, wuxuuna wada gaadhi doonaa reer binu Israa'iil oo dhan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sayidka Rabbiga ahu wuxuu leeyahay, Tanu waa Yeruusaalem. Quruumahaan dhex dhigay, oo hareereheedana waddammaa ku wareegsan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo iyana xukummadaydii bay sharnimadeedii kaga caasiyowday in ka sii badan quruumaha kale, oo qaynuunnadaydiina way ka caasiyowday in ka sii badan waddammada hareereheeda ku wareegsan, waayo, iyagu xukummadaydii iyo qaynuunnadaydiiba way diideen, oo innaba kuma ay socon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sidaas daraaddeed Sayidka Rabbiga ahu wuxuu leeyahay, Quruumaha hareerihiinna ku wareegsan waad ka sii belaayo badiseen, oo qaynuunnadaydiina kuma aydaan socon, oo xukummadaydiina ma aydaan xajin, oo quruumaha idinku wareegsan xukummadoodana ma aydaan samayn, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "haddaba sidaas daraaddeed Sayidka Rabbiga ahu wuxuu leeyahay, Bal eeg, aniga qudhaydu col baan kugu ahay, oo iyadoo quruumuhu ay indhaha ku hayaan ayaan xukummo dhexdaada ku samayn doonaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo waxaan dhexdaada ku samayn doonaa wax aanan hore u samayn, oo hadda ka dibna aanan samayn doonin wax la mid ah, waana waxyaalahaagii karaahiyada ahaa oo dhan daraaddood. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sidaas daraaddeed aabbayaashu dhexdaaday wiilashooda ku cuni doonaan, oo wiilashuna aabbayaashood bay cuni doonaan, oo dhexdaadaan xukummo ku samayn doonaa, oo kuwaaga hadhay oo dhanna waxaan u kala firdhin doonaa dabaylaha oo dhan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sidaas daraaddeed Sayidka Rabbiga ahu wuxuu leeyahay, Noloshaydaan ku dhaartaye, sida xaqiiqada ah, anigu waan ku dhimi doonaa, oo ishayduna kuuma ay tudhi doonto, oo innaba kuuma aan nixi doono, maxaa yeelay, waxaad meeshaydii quduuska ah ku nijaasaysay waxyaalahaagii la nacay oo karaahiyada ahaa oo dhan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saddexdaada dalool baa belaayo u le'an doona, oo abaar bay dhexdaada ugu baabbi'i doonaan, oo daloolna seef buu hareerahaaga ugu le'an doonaa, oo daloolka saddexaadna dabaylaha oo dhan baan ku kala firdhin doonaa, oo seef baan ka daba qaadan doonaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo sidaasaa xanaaqaygu ku dhammaystirmi doonaa, cadhadaydana iyagaan ku dejin doonaa, markaasaan qaboobi doonaa, oo waxay ogaan doonaan inaan aniga Rabbiga ahu qiiradayda kula hadlay markaan cadhadaydii korkooda ku dhammaystiray. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo weliba waxaan kaa dhigi doonaa meel cidla ah iyo cay dhex taal quruumaha hareerahaaga ku wareegsan, iyadoo ay kuwa ku soo ag mara oo dhanba indhaha ku hayaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sidaasay quruumaha hareerahaaga ku wareegsan ugu noqon doontaa cay, iyo ceeb, iyo wax lagu waana qaato, iyo wax lagu yaabo, markaan dhexdaada xukummo ugu sameeyo xanaaq iyo cadho iyo canaan kulul. Aniga Rabbiga ah ayaa sidaas ku hadlay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saasaa noqon doonta markaan dushooda ku soo dayn doono fallaadhaha baas ee abaarta ah, oo inay wax baabbi'iyaan u qaybsan, oo aan u soo diri doono inay idin baabbi'iyaan, oo abaartaan idiin sii badin doonaa, oo ushiinna kibistana waan kala jebin doonaa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "oo waxaan kugu soo dayn doonaa abaar iyo dugaag xunxun, oo iyana way ku gablamin doonaan, oo belaayo iyo dhiig ayaa ku dhex mari doona, oo seef baan kugu soo dayn doonaa. Aniga Rabbiga ah ayaa sidaas ku hadlay.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
